  "id": "7c4a1e2f8b9d3c5e6a0f1b2c3d4e5f6a",
  "name": {
   "zh": "AI 重定目标 · SATA",
   "en": "AI Retarget · SATA"
  },
  "intro": {
   "zh": "SATA：源动作默认导入你自己的动作（FBX 角色动画或骨架动画、BVH 动捕），也可以在「源动作来源」里改成写一句提示词、用 Kimodo 生成（套在标准人身上）；再导入目标角色。点「准备并查看」：两副骨架的部位对应、初始姿势和不送进模型的骨骼都已自动，在视图里看、改（忽略规则默认「SATA（官方人体范围）」，可换「加手指（实验）」）；再点「重定目标并预览」看模型原生的结果；「后处理并预览」定平移、高度和脚底落地；最后打包下载 USD 动画。",
   "en": "SATA: import your own motion (FBX character or skeleton animation, BVH), or set Motion Source to generate it from a prompt with Kimodo; then import the target character. Prepare and View sets up correspondence, initial poses and ignored bones automatically for review (Ignore Rules: official body range, or add fingers). Retarget and Preview shows the model's result; Post-Process and Preview sets translation, height and grounding."
  },
  "author": "Lab2Shot",
  "created": "2026-10-02T12:00:00",
  "deliverable": "retarget_rig",
  "owner": "admin",
  "updated": "2026-10-04T12:00:00"
 },
